
Some coding ideas related to a variety of LispView topics

-----
draw-without-damage-interest.lisp

"example of how to draw on a window without messing with damage events"

-----
image-file-array.lisp

Utility to convert icon files to arrays

-----
object-id.lisp

Code for returning the XView object id and X11 resource id

-----
send-event.doc

Idea for sending events between LispView windows under two different
Lisp sessions

-----
spot-help.doc

Using spot help in LispView

